{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "a47cd74103afefd8d114cf657eb269fe3ad94f8d0bba2835d49faa2244726828", "ja": "再会と波紋", "zh": "重逢与波澜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "622c419a09c427ad10f275a6072e974b397acea4e1787f49b1a50bc9655c7f05", "ja": "友人の静香に宥められるも、育の登場に海美\nの心は大いに乱れ、あずさとの仲を邪魔する\n事を決意する。一方、育はひなたという友人\nを得、あずさは生徒会に転校生との関係を問\nわれていた。学園内に波紋が広がっていく。", "zh": "虽然被朋友静香安抚下来，海美的内心却因育的出现而大乱，并决定妨碍自己与あずさ的关系。另一方面，育结识了名叫ひなた的朋友，而あずさ则被学生会追问与转校生的关系。波澜逐渐在学园内扩散开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "e4fbe072f898b607ca8189f2af2d7855f5595942b1f927356346f1f4bc7111b2", "ja": "もう……驚いた。下級生、それも転校してきた\nばかりの子を、いきなり怒鳴りつけるなんて……。", "zh": "真是的……吓了我一跳。居然对低年级学生，而且还是刚转学来的孩子，一上来就大声斥责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "7dfbdfef1f85c16b4b7425bb37d45454ee90d0c7bdfa277a084069ae68eba3fd", "ja": "海美、貴女は次のミス・ラベンダー。つまり、生徒会長\n候補筆頭なのよ？　影響を考えて行動しなくちゃ……。", "zh": "海美，你可是下一任紫罗兰小姐，也就是说，是学生会长的头号候选人呀？做事必须考虑到影响……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "49f55f4abe962b52f56bcde01916f9d6a138e6a689d9f8e3ba3ac9dccc1d0e4d", "ja": "だって、だって……うわーん！！！", "zh": "可是，可是……呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "388d631bf7667c0da428cd53816f7598b5f54b62dd15b0e8f9d76d4a2aa69cf2", "ja": "ちょっ、海美！　泣くにしても、\nもうすこし慎みのある泣き方を……！", "zh": "等等，海美！就算要哭，也请稍微注意一下哭相……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "6591571915590374fe77cdc459dc2f279064f169895adb997f3c81f886cda7f3", "ja": "ぐすっ……幼なじみだろうと関係ない。私とお姉さまの\n仲をジャマするなら、こっちもジャマしてやる～！", "zh": "抽泣……就算是青梅竹马也没关系。要是你想妨碍我和姐姐大人的关系，那我也要去妨碍你们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "52dd706dc1d1ea2f634c8ac6107a2a09f048be06973559af4cb081cbabab2d01", "ja": "ふぅ、なんだかえらい目にあったねぇ。\n育さん、大丈夫？", "zh": "呼……真是经历了一场够呛的事呢。\n育，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "5b3647ac85cf1e776aaa380b5026b13e0dc3a3a64de5c9ef85eed5ee0365f595", "ja": "ありがとう、ひなたさん。ちょっと\nびっくりしたけど、もう大丈夫。", "zh": "谢谢你，日向。虽然稍微\n吓了一跳，不过已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "d169253d608c1f452bac7a38a4b7f6bca2c515e57a0ea0bd6ac7bc114f209158", "ja": "そう？\nそれならいいんだけども……。", "zh": "这样吗？\n那就好，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "3b81b04731ae226376d0c4db2a48a03e4735e7164cebcbc45e4c4dda76b6938b", "ja": "この感じだと、にぎやかな日が、もうしばらく\n続くような……なんだか、そんな気がするねぇ……。", "zh": "照这个样子，热闹的日子好像还会再持续一阵子……总觉得，是这样的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "144a748a05508a9b26ebf0be8e11a15046b72b84bc0810b11c94dc1cc2dbd52e", "ja": "ミス・ラベンダー！　あなたの一挙手一投足は生徒に\n注目されていること、認識してくださらないと！", "zh": "ミ斯·薰衣草小姐！还请您意识到，您的一举一动都受到学生们的关注！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fdd0bb035b3eb866cc2fe3b2e39e894e093d4f7409ae965f4d86792f87d45745", "ja": "そうですよ。それと、あの中谷育という転校生のこと、\n私たちにもきちんと説明してくださらないと……。", "zh": "是啊。还有，关于那位叫中谷育的转校生，您也得向我们好好说明一下才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "1fd26b137e837af9c31de47921e21f9072007cd5b8e376679b7f96a2aa218043", "ja": "そうね。それはもちろん、説明するわ。\nええと、私と育ちゃんはね……。", "zh": "是啊。当然会好好说明的。\n那个，我和小育呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1013_null", "source_sha256": "f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da", "ja": "放課後……", "zh": "放学后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "dc7e05ac2351c4f989eaf4eb4c9904307a1beaf14c69317d566b821cac6e270b", "ja": "あの転校生のこと、お姉さまに\n聞いてもいいのかしら。でも……。", "zh": "关于那位转校生的事，可以去问\n姐姐大人吗？可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "9986ca2b81a6af5302c3f42a99723e72791490b434f7c0acdb1c242be8e84c93", "ja": "まあ、海美ちゃん……！\n偶然ね、ふふ。", "zh": "哎呀，海美……！真巧呢，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "3fefc9569d6375bc181158ef00965ec8779814d0b2137b520ce2599f820f18a1", "ja": "あっ……お、お姉さま！\nあの、ごきげんよう……！", "zh": "啊……姐、姐姐！\n那个，您好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "76adb5ac8af0bee4d1c821c7f93be95f971dc19e24678ad054cdd84847635dc0", "ja": "ちょうどよかったわ。\n私、海美ちゃんとお話したいことがあったの。", "zh": "真是太好了。\n我正好有些话想和海美聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "d5fa360aebcfedf4e020e58a35e8da8812228f2c10c367cf8e403da799475643", "ja": "はっ、はい！　あの……私も、お姉さまに\nお聞きしたいことがあって……。", "zh": "是、是！那个……我也有想向姐姐请教的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1019_se", "source_sha256": "ca1bb861cd7ac91e1d1642d22016a45edc150633af952bdade736af5f0946b1e", "ja": "ガラッ", "zh": "哗啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "1edc3d18e79fadeebdf6f0e71efe6dcf265c4efa439f0943f204b0b4af5983f2", "ja": "あっ！　もう、どこに行ってたんですか、会長！\n会議が始まってしまいますよ。", "zh": "啊！真是的，您刚才去哪儿了，会长！\n会议马上就要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "c709986f0aae90aef2aa394020a62a22a614a413f00e5e9becfd29975b9d9d1a", "ja": "あっ、わかったわ。……ええと、海美ちゃん。\n転校生の育ちゃんと、仲良くしてあげてね。", "zh": "啊，我明白了。……那个，海美。\n要和转学生育好好相处哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "9306f32765393681f394fb3d774fd5a382d9e95b82d67a7653b0c7ad4dce494b", "ja": "今日は、教職員の方々も参加されるんですから。\n会長が遅刻なんてありえませんよ！　さあ、早く！", "zh": "今天，教职员工们也会参加的。会长迟到什么的，绝对不行！来，快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1024_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_03_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "c8b38cb9bcca180f83a46fdb31f3481e722c15606832a0f3de3a2c22da2f4974", "ja": "……。\n私が……あの子と、仲良く……？", "zh": "……。\n我……要和那孩子成为好朋友……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
